<http://data.silknow.org/object/4e1862df-744e-3411-ac32-4fc256face3e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Waistcoat has narrow shawl collar and four buttons at lower waist.  It is made of ivory silk with a ribbed ground and figured floral pattern.  There is a placket pocket on either side of the front and a dart each side at the armhole.  It is lined with white cotton.  The back is glazed white cotton with tab & buckle adjustment.  There is a later insertion of beige twill at the centre back."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/4e1862df-744e-3411-ac32-4fc256face3e> .

